WEBVTT

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:08.520
Let's do it Gachi style!! Yeah!!

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:12.730
Gachi Rangers, roll out!

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:21.490
They rise up to protect the planet

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:27.120
Doing their best day and night

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:32.790
Their blazing fighting spirits fuse

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:38.250
And the five fighters fight as one

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:41.130
A dark shadow creeps upon us

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:44.220
Someone is crying again today

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:48.560
They bring forth their spirits mysterious power

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.480
to wipe out the Gedoru Empire! Destroy them!

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:56.520
Blast them to smithereens!

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.280
Do it and burn, Gachi style!

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:02.570
Hurry and run, Gachi style!

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:07.490
The heroes of justice are now here!!

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:10.290
Laugh and cry, Gachi style!

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:13.620
Shout and rage, Gachi style!

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:16.670
Peace will come tomorrow

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:28.050
Serious squadron Gachi Rangers!!

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:40.780
I am disappointed by your failures against the Gachi Rangers.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.790
I beg your forgiveness, Your Highness.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:45.790
I was very close to defeating them.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:48.620
You call <i>that</i> close?

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:52.340
You must be both blind <i>and</i> stupid, Jigokku.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:56.010
Shut up, Jama'ara, you old hag!

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:57.630
WHAT DID YOU SAY?!

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:03.100
What's wrong with being an older, more mature lady?!

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:09.100
You're both the same, wasting the cute monsters

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:10.690
created by I, the brilliant A'akuma.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:11.860
SILENCE!

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:16.030
Your monsters are utterly useless!

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:18.280
You brainless piece of trash!

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:19.490
You!

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:20.530
You too!

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:21.990
Hey, cut it out!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.910
Die!

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:24.870
You maggots!

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.120
Hear that?!

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.370
You garbage!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:31.330
I want some too...

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:32.500
...No, no!

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.000
ENOUGH!!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:40.220
You fool! Whip me if you're gonna do it-

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:45.510
I mean, if you have time to fight each other, then come up with a better scheme!

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:48.020
D-Don't worry, your Highness.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.730
I have obtained some valuable information.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.650
Please take a look at this!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.360
Ohhh!

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.530
Oops, wrong page.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.150
Here it is!

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:06.870
According to <i>Kamohashi Sports</i>, Japan is facing a problem with declining birth rates!

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.410
We are going to exacerbate this problem!

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:13.040
Good idea! If all the kids disappear...

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:16.670
Only the old ones will remain, and invading will be much easier, right?

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:18.880
Excellent!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:22.640
Create a new monster for this, and let the plan begin!

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.260
Yes, sir!

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.810
Here goes!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.150
Crabragon, here to stir trouble!

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:41.400
The kids are being targeted!

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:41.400
Countdown to Japan's doom!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:41.280
The kids are being targeted! Countdown to Japan's doom!

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.780
Gedoru, gedoru!

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:50.800
The kids are being targeted! Countdown to Japan's doom!

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.330
I'm scared!

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:55.210
No one's gonna save you, no matter how much you cry!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.590
Pinch pinch, you're damned!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.960
Do it, Crabragon!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.970
Just leave it to me!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.430
Stop there, all of you!

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.720
What?

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.390
L-Let the kids go!

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:07.260
Clamp out of this!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.270
Stay back!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.520
Those aren't gonna work on me!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:23.570
You guys are next!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.030
'Kay, to the next target!

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:31.160
Pinch time!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.880
I wonder what color your panties are today.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.170
Geez, you pervert!

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.760
Pinch time!

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.590
You're doing great, Crabragon!

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:50.310
My panty profiling instinct tells me they're black.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.140
Gesu, you sicko!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.850
Ouch!

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:56.020
Pinch time!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.690
All of Japan's kids will be gone in no time!

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.410
Did I get it right? Did I?

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.450
Gesu, you perv!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.120
Huh?

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.710
Gesu, there's foam everywhere today.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.830
Must be spring cleaning.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:18.460
Urghh...

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.380
CAFE

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:21.380
GON

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.340
We're back!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.710
We got all the supplies!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.340
Oh! Thanks, Momoko, Gesuragon.

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:30.890
Man! I just can't get enough of this mind-blowing spiciness!

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:33.220
It's not curry unless it's seriously spicy!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.770
Right, Yuuichi?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.020
I like sweet curry, too.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.480
You're a real glutton as usual, aren't you, Hiro?

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.900
How about channeling some of those nutrients to your brain instead?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.280
Sorry 'bout that!

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:50.830
My, you're both so childish.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:52.990
Yuki, here's your chocolate parfait.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:55.040
About time!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.670
Don't treat me like a kid!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.000
I'm going in.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.360
*stare*

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:09.180
The cage really is the best place to chill.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:14.180
And I get to peep at Momoko's panties all I want!

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.550
*drool*

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.100
Jeez, you're so perverted!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.230
I <i>knew</i> they were black.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.140
Ouch!

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:28.360
News

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:24.900
The disappearances of numerous children have been reported around Ageo, Saitama.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:28.360
Families with children are advised to exercise extreme caution.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.030
That's terrible.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:34.620
Say, I didn't see any kids on my way back just now.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.410
Saw foam everywhere, though.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:40.500
There's no mistaking this! It must be the work of the Gedoru Empire!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.500
Master, I mean, General Yamaarashi!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.010
To the Gachi Base!

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.720
Today will be another Gachi day!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:57.310
GonGon Café is just a façade to the outside world.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.350
No one realizes that 30 meters above it

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:02.900
lies the secret fortress of justice,

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.770
the Gachi Base!

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.780
As you can see,

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:12.780
children are being dissolved all over Saitama.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.330
This must be one of Gedoru's schemes!

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.290
This is seriously unforgivable!

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.540
How terrible of them!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:22.040
Why only kids, though?

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.290
Any pickled leek?

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:26.250
We must protect the children from the minions of Gedoru!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.050
Serious squadron, roll out!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.670
Gachi!

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:37.640
Gachi Machine, heading out!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:38.930
Red's Driver's License: Suspended

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.390
W-What?

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.820
We're heading to the elementary school.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.700
We'll be going to the childcare center!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.320
I'll take the kindergarten!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:57.240
Slow down a little, bro!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.500
Gachi Rangers, GO!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.250
Dead End!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.250
Damn! I'll find another way!

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.760
Damn! Another one!

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:12.260
Oh!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:15.840
Crap, again?!

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:17.260
W-WHY?!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.010
Uh-oh!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.680
Why can't I reach the school?!

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.810
Is this one of Gedoru's traps?!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.190
How could I, with an IQ of 200, be fooled?!

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:25.940
Nattou goes surprisingly well with this.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.270
Hour Later

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:31.900
Alright, let's go!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.870
No! We were too late!

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.040
Gachi Rangers, slow as trolls!

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.540
Gedoru!

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:43.790
Jama'ara!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.720
The Gachi Jeep!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.550
Baked curry's good, too.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:57.050
That's...!

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.770
You twerps, prepare to die!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.890
Dammit! Yuki!

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.440
Roger! Gachi Sidecar, fire!

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:17.450
I've caught you, Admiral Jikokku!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:19.030
So you're here, Gachi Red!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.990
Try stopping <i>this</i>!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:23.540
Wait!

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:28.380
It's a time bomb!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.920
This is bad, Hiro!

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.800
Please, defuse the bomb!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.130
Leave it to me!

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:38.720
Only 30 minutes to detonation...

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.640
I'll have to take it apart right now!

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:45.680
Cutting one of them should disarm it!

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.980
The yellow, Hiro!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.350
You crazy?! It's the red!

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:51.520
No! You perv!

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.030
A daycare lady who wears black panties, huh?

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:56.030
It's definitely yellow!

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.700
I told you, they're black!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:58.610
Red!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:09:59.200
Yellow!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.200
Red!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.120
Yellow!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.280
Black.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.950
Seriously, it's the red one!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.710
Booom!

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:12.380
Damn those minions of Gedoru.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:15.130
Don't they have any mercy at all?!

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:26.140
Good morning!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.060
Crab morning!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.310
Gedoru, gedoru!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:33.020
Huh? I don't recognize them.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.360
Oh well!

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.070
Pinch time!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:44.790
This bus is being bus-jacked by the Gedoru Empire!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:51.630
Now, captives of this bus, sing this song!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.290
Row, row, row your boat,

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.130
gently down the stream.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.090
Merrily merrily merrily merrily,

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.090
down the River Styx!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:02.090
We're not singing that song!

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:04.640
Cut the crab!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:08.270
Stop it! I won't let you bully our teacher!

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.730
Getting gutsy eh, brat?

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.230
Take this! Gachi Kick!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.060
Ouch!

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:18.150
Damn you! Here's what'll happen to children like you!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.570
Hiroshi!

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.780
Serves him right!

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:27.620
You'll all share the same fate!

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.410
Stop right there, Crabragon!

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:30.160
What?

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:38.710
I'd expected this might happen, so I disguised myself as the driver!

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.720
Hey! The steering wheel!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:42.260
Gedoru, gedoru!

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:44.890
Right! Right!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:46.010
Oh no!

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.470
Left! Left!

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.470
Ahh!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:52.190
I can't control this thing anymore!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.690
Oh crab!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:06.910
How horrible!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.540
Take that, Gachi Rangers!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:16.290
The Gedoru Empire... I'll never forgive them!

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:23.510
W-What's with today's Gachi Rangers?!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.050
They keep screwing up!

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:30.770
It's the first time I've actually watched this show, and it's so stupid it's actually kinda funny.

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:35.150
They're a lot lamer than usual.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.610
But still, Pink's boobies are the best as always!

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.360
That lady villian was cool!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.900
She's so good with her whip!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:46.950
Silence!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:47.910
You maggots!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:51.790
Oh yeah, I wanna have curry for dinner!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.000
Go make some!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.290
Curry! Curry!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:58.710
Weird... Today's episode is definitely weird!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.000
So weird!!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.010
Serious Squadron
Gachi Rangers

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:12.930
W-What the...?

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:26.700
We don't need Gachi Rangers!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.520
Where are the Gachi Rangers?!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:21.780
Hand them over! We know they're in there!

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:24.740
Stop hiding inside, you useless bums!

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:26.700
Death to Their Leader<i>!!</i>

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:26.700
Give me back my grandson!

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:29.490
Hold on a minute, everyone.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:34.080
This is just a small café, and has nothing to do with Gachi Rangers-

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.500
We don't need Gachi Rangers!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.370
Yeah right! Get him!

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.380
Hiroshi!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.170
Hiroshi! Hiroshi!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:50.140
Take this!

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.430
Hirosh-

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.480
Alright tough guy, you're dead meat!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.900
Hiroshi!

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:06.190
Damn! One wrong move and my secret will be revealed!

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:08.070
Die!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.130
Ah, sorry.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.600
W-What happened?

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.270
Today will be another Gachi day!

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.350
Wait there!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.520
Damn it, he got away!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:43.820
Hiroshi!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.570
That was close.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:50.820
How did they know this is the Gachi Rangers base?

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:58.410
General! What happened?

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.500
Well... a lot happened.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:09.470
Hiroshi!

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.760
GonGon is...!

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.840
Don't blame them.

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:16.260
They must've been brainwashed by Gedoru's minions to attack GonGon.

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:18.730
The Gedoru Empire is so horrible.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:22.190
They took away the kids, and now they're mind-controlling their parents!

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:24.230
I won't let them get away with this!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.400
There's no meat!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.900
Why are they only targeting kids?

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:31.990
Wouldn't chicks like Momoko be better?

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:34.990
Gesu, you perv!

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:35.660
Urgh!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.160
Only kids...

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:41.040
That's it! We can use a child to lure them out!

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.790
I see! That just might work!

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:46.800
Wait a sec. That sounds good and all, but...

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:51.340
There are hardly any kids left in Saitama.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:54.050
And no parent would let us use their child as bait.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.300
I'll just have her bear my chi-

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:57.220
Ugh!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.230
Damn. What should we seriously do?

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:01.600
Kids...

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.400
Kids...

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:05.150
Kids...

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:06.900
Meat...

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.650
Kids...

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.650
White...

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:12.200
Kids...

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.110
A kid!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:21.330
Damn them, treating me like a kid...

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:24.460
